OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing flooding,
OL,8,Ftravel disruption, and power cuts
OL,9,Facross the UK
OL,11,FMore than 80,000 customers across Great
OL,12,FBritain were without power at 08:00 GMT
OL,13,F- there are also power cuts across the
OL,14,Fisland of Ireland
OL,16,FOn the railways, people are being told
OL,17,Fnot to travel north of Preston on the
OL,18,FWest Coast Main Line - while on the
OL,19,FEast Coast, LNER advises against travel
OL,20,Fnorth of Edinburgh
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
