OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Scotland, Network Rail says trees
OL,8,Fhave fallen onto lines at "numerous
OL,9,Flocations"; a number of flights across
OL,10,Fthe Irish Sea have been cancelled;
OL,11,Fwhile many ferry services are also
OL,12,Fsuspended
OL,14,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,15,Facross large parts of Scotland and
OL,16,Fnorthern England, with a range of
OL,17,Fevents cancelled
